---
title: Green Bean Casserole
source: Matt
servings: 8
prep time: 25 minutes
cook time: 35 minutes
---

> Cream of celery soup can be substituted for cream of mushroom soup.

Heat oven to 350 F.

In a #bowl{}, mix @cream of mushroom soup{1%can} and @green beans{2%cans}(drained) with @milk{0.5%cup} and @pepper{}. Stir in about @crispy fried onions{0.33%cup}.

Spread into a #baking dish{} greased with non-stick cooking spray.

Bake for ~{25%minutes}.

Add more @crispy fried onions{} on top to cover the casserole.

Bake for another ~{5-10%minutes}, until the onions are golden brown.
